WEBVTT

00:00:00.727 --> 00:00:02.750
847 pages.

00:00:03.227 --> 00:00:04.025
One exam.

00:00:04.515 --> 00:00:05.492
14 days

00:00:06.352 --> 00:00:07.444
Ask a chatbot,

00:00:07.513 --> 00:00:08.949
and it teaches you what you thought to

00:00:08.712 --> 00:00:09.434
ask.

00:00:09.477 --> 00:00:11.372
Your exam asks everything else.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.268
This is Distil.

00:00:16.352 --> 00:00:17.520
Give it your textbook.

00:00:17.691 --> 00:00:19.485
It reads every page,

00:00:19.528 --> 00:00:21.883
and writes down everything there is to learn.

00:00:22.602 --> 00:00:26.321
996 items, each one pinned to the line

00:00:26.084 --> 00:00:26.985
it came from.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:29.497
Then it builds your plan.

00:00:29.668 --> 00:00:31.258
Every item gets a lesson,

00:00:31.301 --> 00:00:32.444
checked in code,

00:00:32.577 --> 00:00:34.536
and scheduled up to your exam date.

00:00:35.727 --> 00:00:37.508
Lessons go one step at a time.

00:00:37.691 --> 00:00:38.758
They cite your book,

00:00:38.763 --> 00:00:40.173
draw what words can't,

00:00:40.255 --> 00:00:41.755
and stop to check you followed.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:44.217
Then it tests you.

00:00:44.388 --> 00:00:45.875
Timed mock exams,

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.235
marked point by point against a scheme,

00:00:48.418 --> 00:00:50.378
even from a photo of your handwriting.

00:00:50.727 --> 00:00:52.890
What you miss comes back as a flashcard,

00:00:52.959 --> 00:00:54.395
right before you'd forget it.

00:00:55.102 --> 00:00:56.577
And you watch it all connect,

00:00:56.582 --> 00:00:58.005
one idea at a time.

00:00:58.852 --> 00:01:00.327
It runs on your computer,

00:01:00.344 --> 00:01:01.474
with your own keys.

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:03.719
And every token is on the record.

00:01:05.102 --> 00:01:06.551
Everything in your syllabus.

00:01:06.977 --> 00:01:07.724
Distilled.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:11.806
Free, and open source.
